            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A communication system is described comprising: a user apparatus; and a base station that configures at least one serving cell for wireless communication with the user apparatus, wherein the base station transmits, to the user apparatus with using RRC signaling, information related to at least one beam used in the at least one serving cell.</p>
